L2.2b␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀bÅ\FË␀␀␀§Å␀␀]␀␀#print
Now your directory contains a file with a name
that starts with "a" (like "adam", "arthur", etc.).
Find it and change its name to "martin".
Then type "ready".
By the way, if there was already a file around
